F1 C2: G1 24 V DC 5 A.  F3 C2: G3 5 V DC 5 A.  F2 C4: G2 36 V 350 W (stepper drivers).  F4, F5 B2: heater SSRs.  F6 C2: G4 24 V DC 5 A, supply of the gear motors.
