 10
20.0
 20
37.0
 30
0.0
 40
2.2
  1
1. Electricity comes in on two wires: L (live) and N (neutral). It flows from L, through a device, and back on N.
  7
VFFS
 11
20.0
 21
37.0
 31
0.0
100
