17
100
AcDbEntity
  8
EXPLAIN
100
AcDbText
 10
20.0
 20
32.6
 30
0.0
 40
2.2
  1
2. Q0 is the main on/off switch. F0 is a safety breaker: it cuts the power very fast if current leaks to the frame or to a person.
  7
VFFS
 11
20.0
 21
32.6
 31
0.0
100
