17
100
AcDbEntity
  8
EXPLAIN
100
AcDbText
 10
20.0
 20
28.2
 30
0.0
 40
2.2
  1
3. F1 to F6 are small breakers, one for each branch. If one branch has a short circuit, only its own breaker trips.
  7
VFFS
 11
20.0
 21
28.2
 31
0.0
100
